# Build context for Dockerfile-Mainnet ONLY.
#
# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root .dockerignore, so this scopes
# the mainnet image without touching legacy/Dockerfile-AO's context. The legacy image is being
# retired, not maintained; it should not get a vote in what the mainnet deploy surface contains.
#
# Deny everything, then admit exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs — the same list, in the same
# order. Written this way round on purpose: a denylist only excludes what someone remembered,
# whereas nothing here is admitted unless it was named, so a secret, scratch dump or key file
# added anywhere in the repo is outside this context the day it lands.
#
# That is why there is no "exclude .env / test-keys / node_modules" section. Those were never
# admitted. ao/.env holds DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY and is gitignored (CI never sees it), but a local
# `docker build .` would otherwise ship it to the daemon; here it simply is not in the context.
#
# This cannot fail open. Drop a line and the matching COPY fails and the build stops; it can
# never silently include more than is listed.

*

!ao/package.json
!ao/bun.lock
!ao/tsconfig.json

!ao/runtime/native.lua
!ao/runtime/write-gate.lua
!ao/runtime/vendor/json.lua

!ao/src/contracts/common/bigint.lua
!ao/src/contracts/common/eip55.lua
!ao/src/contracts/common/errors.lua
!ao/src/contracts/common/utils.lua

!ao/src/contracts/native/operator-registry.lua
!ao/src/contracts/native/relay-rewards.lua
!ao/src/contracts/native/staking-rewards.lua

!ao/scripts/deploy.ts
!ao/scripts/publish-module.ts
!ao/scripts/build-seed.ts
!ao/scripts/build-relay-seed.ts
!ao/scripts/build-staking-seed.ts
!ao/scripts/build-native-bundle.ts
!ao/scripts/util/native-bundle.ts

!ao/scripts/snapshot-state.ts
!ao/scripts/publish-snapshot.ts
!ao/scripts/verify-snapshot.ts
!ao/scripts/recover-from-arweave.ts

!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-operator-registry.state.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-operator-registry.roles.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-relay-rewards.state.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-relay-rewards.roles.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-staking-rewards.state.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/live-staking-rewards.roles.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/stage-operator-registry.state.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/stage-operator-registry.roles.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/stage-relay-rewards.state.json
!ao/state-dumps/2026-07-09/stage-relay-rewards.roles.json
